    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know. everything just feels so automated lately. like i'm just going through parts of a script every day. i wake up, i work, i scroll, i sleep. it's all just data points. i feel like if i just stopped, the world wouldn't even glitch. it would just keep running like nothing ever happened. i'm just a ghost in the machine at this point.",
