      "content": "idk if a \"glitch\" would even help. it feels more permanent than that. like, i'm just an error in the code that keeps happening. everyone around me is just performing their roles too, so no one actually sees me. if i just... uninstalled myself or something, would anyone even notice the gap i left? or would the system just patch it out immediately?",
